      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 1357587368,
      "text": "Agathosma betulina is a flowering plant in the family Rutaceae, native to the lower elevation mountains of western South Africa, where it occurs near streams in fynbos habitats."
    },
    "es": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (es): Agathosma betulina",
